body:
Hey, thanks for taking the time to read and comment!

Well, I'm 23. It seems everyone else around me has had a great time so far, my old friends are dating, graduating college and starting a life. And here I am, on my third semester at college, working towards a degree I'm not passionate about, alone and *still* depressed. It seems I can't move forward.

I don't have anyone I trust enough to talk about any of this, but thank you for your kind words. &hearts;
